  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: GetRowsOfSheet now returns a new array per row; use GetRowsOfSheetReadOnly for the reused-buffer scan. Adds reusable cell styles for header rows and A1 ranges (XLSX alignment and wrapping included), preserves number, date and boolean types in untyped columns, escapes ST_Xstring and CR in shared and inline strings, recognises date formats by token, and keeps the full width of sparse rows.",
